## Third-party data

The telecom knowledge graph referenced by this project originates from the
3GPP Release 19 Telecom Knowledge Graph published by GSMA and developed by
Khalifa University Research Institute for Digital Future (KU-DF).

Dataset page:

https://huggingface.co/datasets/GSMA/telecom-kg-rel19

The upstream graph, mappings, and metadata are third-party materials. Check the
upstream dataset card and license before redistributing them.

## Standards documents

3GPP specifications are not authored by this project. Downloaded specification
archives, extracted DOCX/PDF files, parsed chunks, and generated indexes are
kept out of Git by default. Users are responsible for obtaining standards
documents from appropriate sources and complying with applicable terms.

The local development pipeline used TS 24.501 v19.2.0, source code `24501-j20`.
